Frequently Asked Questions

What do I enter when the timer stops?
Enter the total gallon number shown on the dispenser, exactly as displayed. The app subtracts your start offset automatically to calculate the net gallons and GPM.

Why does the draw number start at 1 for each site?
Draw numbers reset per site so each location has its own clean sequence. Draws with no site assigned share their own count starting at 1.

How many draws can I store?
Up to 100 draws are stored locally on your device. When draw #101 is saved, the oldest draw is automatically removed to keep the total at 100.

Is any data sent to the internet?
No. All data is stored locally on your device. The app does not require an account, internet connection, or any external service.
